# Vercel serves only the static frontend. The Express backend runs on Render.
#
# The Vercel project's Root Directory is currently "backend", so Vercel reads
# backend/vercel.json, which copies ../frontend into the build output.
# Hide every backend file except that config, so Vercel never detects the
# Express app (that caused 500 FUNCTION_INVOCATION_FAILED).
backend/*
!backend/vercel.json
run-local.sh
